%t A323431 Table[Sum[Length[Select[Union[Sort/@Tuples[IntegerPartitions[#,{k}]&/@ptn]],UnsameQ@@Join@@#&&And@@OrderedQ/@Transpose[#]&]],{ptn,IntegerPartitions[n]},{k,Min[ptn]}],{n,30}]
%o A323431 (PARI)
%o A323431 A_q(N) = {my(q='q+O('q^(N+1))); Vec(1 + sum(a=1,floor(1/2+sqrt(2*N)), sum(b=1,floor(1/2+sqrt(2*N)), (a*b)! * q^((a*b)*(a*b+1)/2) * prod(i=1,a-1, i!) / (prod(j=b,a+b-1, j!) * prod(k=1,a*b, 1 - q^k)))))} \\ _John Tyler Rascoe_, Aug 29 2026
